                            },
                            {
                              "nodeType": "paragraph",
                              "data": {},
                              "content": [
                                {
                                  "nodeType": "text",
                                  "value": "Our edge? Cultural Value. the power that moves people, brands, and the world forward. We help brands earn it, live it, and lead with it, rooted in what truly matters. ",
                                  "marks": [],
                                  "data": {}
                                }
